<title>SWEDEN: Finland air cargo volumes rise 9 pct in March.</title>
<headline>Finland air cargo volumes rise 9 pct in March.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland's domestic and international airports handled 8,442 tonnes of freight in March, a 9.4 percent rise on a year ago, Finland's civil aviation administration said on Friday.</p>
<p>The administration published the following figures about airport activity for the month.</p>
<p>			    March 1997     Pct change vs March 1996</p>
<p> Cargo (in tonnes)	 8,442		    +9.4</p>
<p> Mail (in tonnes)	  1,647		    +1.2</p>
<p> Passengers	    1,017,896		    +2.4</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
